    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51280" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰστρίδες</span></b> , αἱ, a kind
		of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>garment</i>
				(perh.f.l. for foreg.(or for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝεστρ-</span>)), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰστυάζει:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργίζεται</span>, Id.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶστρος</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰστυλόν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ στυχηδόν</span> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στοιχηδόν</span>), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴστω</span></b> , 3sg.
			imper. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶδα</span>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴττω</span>.</div>
